%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 705b193c12cddfb48bd3281455bd9c63, type: 3}
  m_Name: DLG_InfoDesk
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Alcax.Dialogue.DialogueTree
  startNode: start
  nodes:
  - id: start
    line: Welcome to Atrium C. I'm Ines, guest services. What can I do for you?
    choices:
    - text: Where am I, exactly?
      next: where
    - text: What's that planet out there?
      next: planet
    - text: Are those ships landing outside?
      next: ships
    - text: Anything I should know about?
      next: rumor
    - text: Nothing for now, thanks.
      next: bye
  - id: where
    line: Hydroponics Deck, Atrium C. These gardens feed about four hundred crew. The mezzanine is open to visitors. The blast doors lead to the labs, and those are crew only.
    choices:
    - text: Ask something else.
      next: start
    - text: Thanks.
      next: bye
  - id: planet
    line: 'That''s Tessaly, a gas giant. We''re on its moon, Kharon. All that sand out there is silica: sixty-one degrees in the shade at noon, and minus forty at night. The glass is three layers thick, so don''t worry.'
    choices:
    - text: How long is a day here?
      next: day
    - text: Ask something else.
      next: start
  - id: day
    line: Kharon is tidally locked, so Tessaly never moves in our sky. We run on station time. You'll get used to the sunsets lasting forever.
    choices:
    - text: Ask something else.
      next: start
    - text: Good to know.
      next: bye
  - id: ships
    line: 'Supply shuttles up from the orbital ring. Pads One and Two get a drop every few minutes: water ice, seed stock, spare parts. If you''re lucky you''ll catch one lifting off at dusk.'
    choices:
    - text: Can I ride one?
      next: ride
    - text: Ask something else.
      next: start
  - id: ride
    line: Only with a transfer permit, and the permit office is... also me. Come back when you've got paperwork.
    choices:
    - text: Ask something else.
      next: start
    - text: Fair enough.
      next: bye
  - id: rumor
    line: Between us? Night shift says the lab doors have been cycling on their own. Probably a sensor fault. Probably.
    choices:
    - text: Who could I ask about that?
      next: rumor2
    - text: Ask something else.
      next: start
    - text: I'll keep my eyes open.
      next: bye
  - id: rumor2
    line: The lab supervisor, Dr. Hale, if you can find her. She hasn't checked in since Tuesday. Don't tell anyone I said that.
    choices:
    - text: Ask something else.
      next: start
    - text: My lips are sealed.
      next: bye
  - id: bye
    line: Enjoy the view. It never gets old.
    choices: []
